{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LhYmmIkxej1792990761.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam片段，事發在元朗青山公路元朗段，一輛藍色私家車行駛至行人過路處時，懷疑睇錯燈號衝紅燈，直衝過路處。當時一名男途人正橫過馬路，差一步便遭私家車撞倒，幸好男途人反應及時停步。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-26-12h51m45s596.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OT3dTYq5161792990729.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>惟男途人即時抬腳一腳猛力踢向私家車車身，私家車隨即停下，男途人疑上前與司機理論，期間司機一度打開車門欲下車應對，惟男途人此時已離去，私家車最終開車離開。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-26-12h51m51s192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mCDj8LNbmA1792990735.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>這段影片隨即在網絡上引爆熱烈討論，有網民對男途人的出腳直呼「踢得勁大力」，但亦有網民指私家車衝燈極度危險：「咁樣都衝紅燈」，不少網民則指雙方都有法律責任，坦言：「一個危駕，一個刑毀」，指兩邊行為均不可取。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:00:18.138457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.860999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:58:06.954993+00:00","content_hash":"df1899eafa6947aa162f39c08b57f921777a8f3b21043d93ef6c034cef87eba5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:00:18.138457+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}